      "detection_logic": "An internet-facing web application containing custom code that does not record validates_input. Redirect targets are the most common unvalidated string in a login or checkout flow, and the model has no separate field for them, so input validation stands in as the control.\n",
      "false_positives": "Applications with no redirect parameter at all, and those that only ever redirect to relative paths. If every redirect target is a path rather than a URL, this rule has nothing to say; record validates_input to retire it.\n",
